# Opaque arm: a match arm containing an undefined variable in the pattern position
# is treated as opaque (has_guards = true) by the type checker's coverage analysis.
# At eval time, an undefined VarRef in a keyed arm pattern resolves to Some(None) —
# the arm does not silently match everything; it simply does not match.
# The fallback arm (wildcard) is reached correctly.
[
  # undefined-name is not in scope — resolution yields Some(None) → arm does not match.
  # The wildcard arm must fire.
  result: [match 42
    undefined-name: "should not match"
    ...:            "fallback"]
]

=== out
["result": "fallback"]
